description:
Implement the native handler for `bdh dep add|remove` when bd is not initialized.

Subcommands:
- `bdh dep add <ref> <depends-on>` — maps to POST /v1/tasks/{ref}/deps with body {depends_on: dep_ref}
- `bdh dep remove <ref> <dep-ref>` — maps to DELETE /v1/tasks/{ref}/deps/{dep_ref}

Handle cycle detection errors (the API returns a ValidationError).

Output: confirmation message with the two refs involved.
